# The split-component Compose deployment under deploy/ IS a committed deliverable,
# so it is exempted from the "Preview Docker test setup" block above (which ignores
# `Dockerfile`, `.dockerignore` and `.env` at ANY depth). Un-ignored last so it wins.
# The generated local `deploy/.env` stays ignored — only `deploy/.env.example` is
# committed, and it carries no real secret.
!deploy/**
# …and re-ignore what the blanket exception above would otherwise pull back in.
# `!deploy/**` overrides EVERY earlier rule for that subtree, including
# `node_modules/` and `*-debug.log` — so state the exceptions to the exception.
deploy/.env
deploy/**/.env
deploy/**/*.local.yml
deploy/node_modules/
deploy/**/node_modules/
deploy/**/*-debug.log
